			id: "34000000000003C5"
			title: "Wheat Harvest"
			subtitle: "Replant as you reap."
			description: [
				"Bring in a real wheat harvest and save part of every cut for reseeding. Wheat feeds bread, animal breeding, and a few early trades, so a steady supply pays off."
				"Mature plants give one seed back at minimum, so a field that is replanted as it is cut keeps itself going."
			]
